{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TINY DINO is an idle nurturing game where little dinosaurs accompany you at the bottom of your screen while you work or study.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They produce gems for you to earn profits, and you can plant trees and build structures to create a free and lively world for them, growing together with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect a variety of tiny dino</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grass, Fire, Water... Dinosaurs of different elements come in different colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your colorful and vibrant dinosaur army!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Interact with your dino</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can pick them up anytime, feed them, and pet them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They\u2019ll even chase after the food you throw!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Breed new life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to raise the most unique and charming little dinosaurs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build your dino haven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant trees, construct buildings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free your hands and let them thrive on their own!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678750?t=1745800185","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678750?t=1745800185","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678750/79f981d1a562b4ef770c0d9c3704c2cc59b586bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745800185","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678750/79f981d1a562b4ef770c0d9c3704c2cc59b586bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745800185","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TINY DINO is an idle nurturing game where little dinosaurs accompany you at the bottom of your screen while you work or study.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They produce gems for you to earn profits, and you can plant trees and build structures to create a free and lively world for them, growing together with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect a variety of tiny dino</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grass, Fire, Water... Dinosaurs of different elements come in different colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your colorful and vibrant dinosaur army!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Interact with your dino</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can pick them up anytime, feed them, and pet them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They\u2019ll even chase after the food you throw!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Breed new life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to raise the most unique and charming little dinosaurs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build your dino haven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant trees, construct buildings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free your hands and let them thrive on their own!</p>","developers":["Pixfox"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678750/68502c10a8533435881fd820cc8c97f321218a9b/header.jpg?t=1745800185","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127386,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127386/movie480.mp4?t=1745774552","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127386/